        {"needs": ["name"], "text": "Everyone in {city} knows the {n} {entities} who protect it. Nobody knows who they really are, except you, if you can crack these clues."},
        "{city} has never been safer, thanks to {n} {entities} who patrol its streets. {group} keeps careful files on all of them, but a coffee spill has left the records a mess."
      ],
      "roles": {
        "alias": {
